SUMMARY:Special Celebratory Dinner (St Andrew Station)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**On Saturday May 9th\, we will celebrate 
 the retirement of one of our members at La Fenice\,** serving award-winnin
 g Italian food from the heart of downtown Toronto’s Entertainment Distri
 ct.\nRelish in the taste of authentic Tuscan dishes\, elevated and served 
 fresh from the best Italian restaurant on King St. From pre-show to post s
 how\, date night\, or a weekday lunch\, experience the joy that a great me
 al can make. Enjoy our expertly grilled meat\, seafood and plant-based opt
 ions. I have been here several times for lunch over more than a decade\, a
 nd looking forward to celebrating this special occasion over dinner.\n\n**
 SIGNING-UP**\n\n* RSVP Yes\n* A reminder will be sent the night before wit
 h my cell and all meetup details. Make sure you set up your communication 
 settings to receive.\n\nRSVPs close once all seats are taken. Cancellation
 s will result in a No Show and impact future attendance.\n\n**MEETUP TIME*
 *\n**Meet me at: 7pm inside the front doors of La Fenice Tuscan Grill at 3
 19 King St. W.** Please wait for me to arrive\, and do not sit on your own
  prior\, so we can get the table requested.\n\nLength: 2 hours\n\nEnjoy an
 d please post your Comments in the event after.
